//! The rendering contract and its renderers: a scene hands over a
//! G-buffer and proxies, and a renderer owns the light — lit, ray traced,
//! probe GI, a path tracer, clay — with physically based shading, the sky
//! the air makes, lamps, a planar mirror, fog and clouds, a camera,
//! metered and local exposure, temporal antialiasing and upscaling, depth
//! of field, glow, film and a stylized look.
package render@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
